DESCRIPTION:Being able to clearly and confidently talk about your research
  is a valuable skill in any field. This interactive workshop will introdu
 ce you to the fundamentals of delivering a strong chalk talk and elevator
  pitch. You'll learn how to explain your work to different audiences\, hi
 ghlight its significance\, and communicate your ideas effectively.
DURATION:PT1H30M
