 a is an Associate General Counsel at Duke University and Duke University 
 Health System and a ¡DALHE! Executive Sponsor. \n\nVirtual Cafecitos are 
 an opportunity for Duke Latiné/Hispanic staff and allies to create and ma
 intain open dialogue around topics of leadership\, networking\, mentorshi
 p\, inclusion\, professional development\, and more! Attendees will learn
  about the guest of honor's background\, career path\, and current role\,
  as well as have the opportunity for questions and discussion. \n \nAll D
 uke staff are welcome to join!\n\nRegister at https://tinyurl.com/july-ca
 fecito
